   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Tant... que, si bien que",
     "texto": [
      "**Tant de** + noun + **que** = so... that: **Il y a tant de boue que nous rentrons à pied** (there is so much mud that we walk home).",
      "**Si bien que** (so that) introduces the consequence: **Il a beaucoup plu, si bien que la route est fermée** (it has rained a lot, so the road is closed)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Real consequence or purpose",
     "texto": [
      "A confirmed consequence takes the indicative: **Il a plu, si bien que la route est fermée**. **De sorte que** can also express a sought purpose; in that case it takes the subjunctive: **Je parle lentement de sorte que chacun puisse comprendre** (I speak slowly so that everyone can understand)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
